note ======== OM-2 words (spec/omegese-om2.md): reserved only in an OM-2 unit. rotr 59, rotl 60 are
note binary operators; dit 225 and scrub 226 are program-mode value words (OMEGESE 9.13.1); the rest are
note statement and declaration words of later sections. ========
fn kw2 w ulong to ulong
