note fspan: a deferred literal stored as pos*16777216+len. Input stays below 2^23 bytes, so neither part
note overflows its field; the old pos*64+len read a literal of 64 or more characters from the wrong span (#965).
fn fspan ty ulong packed ulong to ulong
fparse div packed 16777216 rem packed 16777216
ret fbits ty
