wrword 0 1179403647
wrword 4 65794
wrword 16 11993090
wrword 20 1
wrword 24 4194480
wrword 32 64
wrword 52 3670080
wrword 56 2
wrword 64 1
wrword 68 5
wrword 80 4194304
wrword 88 4194304
wrword 112 4096
wrword 120 1
wrword 124 6
wrword 136 268435456
wrword 144 268435456
